%N A126522 Number of base 27 n-digit numbers with adjacent digits differing by four or less.
%C A126522 [Empirical] a(base,n)=a(base-1,n)+9^(n-1) for base>=4n-3; a(base,n)=a(base-1,n)+9^(n-1)-2 when base=4n-4
%H A126522 Rafał Wiktorowicz, <a href="/A126371/a126371_1.pdf">Proofs of the conjectured recurrences and generating functions for the adjacent-digits family</a>, 2026.
%H A126522 <a href="/index/Rec#order_14">Index entries for linear recurrences with constant coefficients</a>, signature (16,-62,-68,477,83,-1049,2,912,-44,-316,13,35,-1,-1).
%o A126522 (S/R) stvar $[N]:(0..M-1) init $[]:=0 asgn $[]->{*} kill +[i in 0..N-2](($[i]`-$[i+1]`>4)+($[i+1]`-$[i]`>4))
%Y A126522 Cf. Base 27 differing by three or less A126495, two or less A126414, one or less A126381.
